Policy fixtures for the sso_direct gate's analyser (policy_test.go). Each file is
the policy *document* only.

ReadOnlyAccess.json  arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/ReadOnlyAccess, version v190
                     (created 2026-09-24), fetched 2026-10-30 with
                     aws iam get-policy-version --version-id v190
ViewOnlyAccess.json  arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/job-function/ViewOnlyAccess,
                     version v47 (created 2026-10-14), fetched 2026-10-30 with
                     aws iam get-policy-version --version-id v47
guardrail.json       an anonymised real-world all-Deny inline policy: a
                     NotAction service allowlist plus a concrete action
                     denylist, and an S3 object-read deny outside two log
                     buckets (placeholder names). ReadOnlyAccess + this
                     guardrail is the permission set the gate must pass.

When AWS publishes a new default version, refresh the two managed-policy files
and this README, then rerun the tests: a new non-read verb in either policy
needs a reviewed NonStandard entry (verbs.go) before the tests pass again.
